                                                    "patching_rect": [ 520.0, 526.0, 455.0, 108.0 ],
                                                    "text": "Model_Gain scales the spectral model. Auto Level applies its compensation. GLOBAL OUTPUT GAIN controls all group outputs and the mono sum; default 0.1 (−20 dB). The help patch’s monitor gain is an additional parent-patch control.",
