                                                    "text": "Render Limit: 128\nSlider Count: 32\nPartial sequence: 0 / one-to-one\nSource f0: 55 Hz\nGlobal output gain: 0.1\nPartial Offset: OFF, number 1\nAnchor Mirror: OFF; scale 1.0\nDetune shape: Flat Zero\nPrimary amplitude shape: Linear high-to-low\nAnchor shape: Flat Zero\nLane DEL: 0 ms for all lanes\nFrequency window: 20–12000 Hz\nAuto Level: ON, 100%, 300 ms, max boost 6 dB",
